     capsicum(4), procdesc(4)

HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The ppddffoorrkk(), ppddggeettppiidd(), and ppddkkiillll() system calls first appeared in
     FreeBSD 9.0.

     Support for process descriptors mode was developed as part of the
     TrustedBSD Project.

